{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB今晚（3日）震撼宣布，將破天荒推出結合「煮食」與「選秀」的全新綜藝真人騷《星廚》，目標是發掘既有廚藝又有 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB今晚（3日）震撼宣布，將破天荒推出結合「煮食」與「選秀」的全新綜藝真人騷《星廚》，目標是發掘既有廚藝又有星味的「烹飪界型男索女」！為此節目已正式展開全球招募，誓要打造新世代偶像廚神，究竟誰能「入得廚房，出得廳堂」？\n</p>\n<h2>《星廚》結合煮食選秀 打造新世代偶像廚神</h2>\n<p>TVB近年成功打造多個話題選秀節目，這次推出的《星廚》將開拓全新偶像賽道。節目有別於一般煮食或選秀騷，不僅嚴格要求參賽者的烹飪實力，更會全面審視其舞台魅力、鏡頭感及個人風格等偶像特質，旨在尋找一位全方位的「新世代偶像廚神」。為隆重其事，節目於今日（3日）正式展開全球招募，並將於11月17日（周二）晚上11時59分（香港時間）截止報名，為有志者提供一個展現實力的華麗舞台。</p>\n<h2>新生代型男美女拍宣傳片 吳敬浩神還原謝霆鋒Chok甫</h2>\n<p>為了打響頭炮，TVB特別找來新生代型男吳敬浩（Justin）及美女陳芷珊（Tracy）拍攝首發宣傳片。片中二人換上多個造型，包括型男索女Look、古裝Look及廚師Look，陳芷珊大騷音樂才華彈結他賣萌，而吳敬浩則盡展舞功。最搶鏡的一幕，莫過於吳敬浩神模仿謝霆鋒經典的「灑鹽Chok甫」，姿勢入型入格，極具記憶點，成功為節目製造首個話題。\n</p>\n<h2>開拓全新偶像賽道 跳出傳統歌唱演藝框框</h2>\n<p>《星廚》的推出，標誌著TVB銳意跳出傳統歌唱及演藝選秀的框架，為偶像定義開創更多可能性。節目概念強調「廚藝＋星味」，意味著未來的偶像不僅要在鏡頭前發光發亮，更需要具備實用的生活技能，以更貼地的形象吸引觀眾。這種創新的比賽模式，旨在發掘更多元化的人才，為娛樂圈注入一股前所未見的新血，打破觀眾對偶像的既定印象。</p>\n<h2>網民期待值爆燈：「終於有新嘢睇！」</h2>\n<p>節目消息一出，立即引起網民熱烈討論，對新穎的節目形式表示期待。不少網民留言大讚有新意：「TVB終於有新嘢睇！煮食加選秀好似幾有gimmick！」、「想睇靚仔靚女煮嘢食，唔知啲評判係邊個？」、「全球招募？有冇年齡限制？有啲心動想報名！」亦有網民表示：「希望唔好又係劇本啦，想睇真實嘅廚藝比拼。」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01_13533326786ae97f9825dcb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01_13533326786ae97f9825dcb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_5989789476ae97fabb74a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_5989789476ae97fabb74a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_4102792456ae97fb2df79c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_4102792456ae97fb2df79c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_18339345696ae97fb787748.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_18339345696ae97fb787748.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%98%9f%e5%bb%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">星廚</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%81%b8%e7%a7%80%e7%af%80%e7%9b%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">選秀節目</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535108\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:13.577015+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1360,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:33:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:19:13.706031+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:59:05.562348+00:00","content_hash":"a9e7c255fdbc6642b1b05c07dbf75700691226241b872aa182d7a8ea20f643e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}